oolName":"bash","toolCallId":"call_djxWbEoK2eMhhgytF5XLjAKY|fc_0956e39e2e21699f016a86966a14648193941ba0dac8f80c57","args":{"command":"grep -n \"shoot\\|swipe\\|drag\\|fli\" .claude/skills/agent-emulator-debugging/SKILL.md | head -n 80"}}},{"sequence":2829,"timestamp":"2026-08-20T05:53:47.043801Z","elapsed_seconds":156.304,"source":"pi","event":{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolName":"bash","toolCallId":"call_djxWbEoK2eMhhgytF5XLjAKY|fc_0956e39e2e21699f016a86966a14648193941ba0dac8f80c57","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"11:## Step 0: `drive.py preflight`\n16:$D preflight\n27:For desktop sessions, `preflight` also reports the concrete sidecar paths it will use in `drive_paths`:\n48:export DRIVE_TARGET=linux   # whatever preflight reported; or unset for the sniff/Android default\n51:$D preflight          # detect environment + recommend next command (Step 0)\n58:$D shoot before_x     # PNG \u2192 .tmp/agent_shots/before_x.png (adb screencap on android,\n102:Prefer a direct drive.py subcommand or extension over gesture synthesis when the harness can target the behavior semantically (for example seek/next/prev/settings/nav). Use adb swipes or taps only when there is no direct control surface.\n113:| Wrong pixels / label rendered wrong | `probe <key>` (live text + resolved TextStyle), `shoot` (PNG) |\n123:- **Velocity-gated gestures need widget tests.** `adb shell input swipe` injects fixed-cadence synthetic events whose computed velocity is far below a real flick, so hero swipes / `PageView` flings / dismissibles silently no-op. Don't chase them via adb/VM service \u2014 regress with `tester.fling(finder, Offset(dx, 0), velocity)` (see `test/screens/void_screen_test.dart`, B-027). ADB swipes are fine for coarse distance-only pan/scroll.\n129:1. **\"could not find Dart VM service URI\"** \u2014 the app isn't in debug mode (release build / `flutter run` exited), or the configured run log / websocket cache points at a dead session. Run `$D preflight` to see what'